{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_05",
  "title": "曲径求胜",
  "storyCode": "DH-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c54bfc2d5f6f800ca91b2dfd2b41117b8d07d3c4acdca722050fffb0804f7a75",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随着比赛的进行，先头部队已经通过了骑行检查点，而就在这时，比赛也迎来了一些变化！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在第一轮比赛中大显神威的鼠胆龙威队，在通过了骑行检查点并骑上了车后，立刻就遭到了其他队伍的重点照顾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，这一次他们似乎改变了策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，能否请您为大家讲解一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不明摆着吗，这帮人知道自己就算一起上也未必是这支队伍的对手，于是选择拖住他们的脚步，而不是打败他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跑步环节即使用这种方法也很容易被这两人近身，但是骑行阶段，在车上很多招式不好施展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以他们选择在骑行环节这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不说，效果不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实，他们紧紧跟在鼠胆龙威队附近，不上前进攻，只用各种手段进行骚扰，让鼠胆龙威队无法安心地赶路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们看到，鼠胆龙威队现在已经落后先头部队许多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑在车上施展不开，而下车只会落后！鼠胆龙威队，面临着比赛开始以来最大的危机！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的目的不是打败我们，是拖住我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办，两位，骑行中战斗是很困难的，这样下去我们要被完全拖住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）看来，有人想让我们抄近道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）闯一闯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了摆脱阻碍自己的其他队伍选手，鼠胆龙威队选择了插入巷道之中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，正如我们在别的舞台所看到的，在巷道中，等待着我们的选手的，是这座城市的精锐部队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我也想为各位讲解其他队伍的视角，但是鼠胆龙威队实在是太吸引人注目了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠胆龙威队此举究竟是自寻死路，还是险中求胜，让我们拭目以待！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，走这边！这条巷子很隐秘，我估计没人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在埃内斯托回头的一瞬间，一支弩箭从角落处向他激射而来，却被林雨霞用手刀截开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伏兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伏兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位，这里交给我，你们快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃内斯托说着将一把钥匙丢给陈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）这把钥匙你们拿着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）那边有一家我开的武器店，你们过去应该就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）武器店的地下室有一扇后门，从后门出去有一个地下行道，走那边会快很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我在这里拖住他们，你们先走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你一个人没问题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有一个人到达终点就算胜利，两位，你们先走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先突破这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
